{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Generate a high-end, minimalist E-commerce Landing Page layout with the following precise structure and content, perfectly recreating the visual balance of the source image.
    
    ### Layout Structure:
    The final image must feature a split-screen design. 
    - A distinct vertical border defines the central image block.
    - On the left side, there is a substantial white space.
    - Centered horizontally within the white space on the left is a block of vertical Japanese serif text.
    - The right side contains the main hero image block, which is a portrait-oriented photograph (4:5 aspect ratio) featuring a woman.
    
    ### Left Text Block Details:
    - **Position:** Precisely centered vertically and horizontally within the left-hand negative space, perfectly aligned with the visual mass of the text block shown in the source.
    - **Font:** A refined, classical Japanese serif font (such as Mincho or similar).
    - **Color:** Dark gray (not jet black), with high legibility.
    - **Content:** The exact text content, line-for-line, from the original image (6 identical lines of Japanese text, with a period at the end of each line):
      テキストが入ります。テキストが入ります。
      テキストが入ります。テキストが入ります。
      テキストが入ります。テキストが入ります。
      テキストが入ります。テキストが入ります。
      テキストが入ります。テキストが入ります。
      テキストが入ります。テキストが入ります。
    - **Styling:** Maintain the specific line-height and letter-spacing from the original image to create the correct visual block.
    
    ### Right Image Block Details:
    - **Subject:** A full-body, back-view photograph of a lone woman walking away on a sandy beach.
    - **Attire:** The woman is wearing a flowing, light-colored (white/cream) maxi dress or robe, which she is holding slightly in one hand, causing it to drape.
    - **Pose:** Back view, captured in motion, walking from the wet sand towards the incoming waves.
    - **Setting & Atmosphere:** The scene is a vast beach at sunrise or sunset. The light is diffused, creating a golden, ethereal, and slightly overexposed haze. The sky is covered in soft, high clouds, and the sun is visible through the haze as a bright, diffused disc, matching the lighting in the source image. The waves are gentle, and the sand is wet and reflective near the water's edge.
    - **Color Palette:** Warm, muted gold, cream, soft white, and pale gray-brown tones. A sepia-toned or gold-washed photograph feel.
    - **Framing:** The woman is small in the frame, centered vertically within the portrait-oriented photo, with ample negative space in the sky above. The photograph itself has a clean white border (or is set against the larger white canvas).
    
    ### Overall Aesthetics:
    The entire image must have a professional, minimalist, luxury Japanese boutique design feel. There should be a sense of quiet elegance and open space. No other elements, logos, or navigation should be present within this specific composition area. The image should look like a clean page from a high-end print lookbook, rendered as a digital design.
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-luxury-landing-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding }}px 0;
  }

  .ai-luxury-landing-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    min-height: {{ block.settings.min_height }}px;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .ai-luxury-landing-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: {{ block.settings.text_area_padding }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
  }

  .ai-luxury-landing-text-block-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    text-orientation: mixed;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.text_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.text_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.text_font.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.text_font.style }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.text_size }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.line_height }};
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.letter_spacing }}em;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    text-align: left;
    white-space: pre-line;
  }

  .ai-luxury-landing-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: {{ block.settings.image_area_padding }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
  }

  .ai-luxury-landing-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.image_max_width }}px;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-luxury-landing-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
  }

  .ai-luxury-landing-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-luxury-landing-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-luxury-landing-empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 20px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    padding: 12px 20px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #666;
    text-align: center;
    pointer-events: none;
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-luxury-landing-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .ai-luxury-landing-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      {% if block.settings.mobile_layout == 'text_first' %}
        order: 1;
      {% else %}
        order: 2;
      {% endif %}
      padding: {{ block.settings.mobile_text_padding }}px;
    }

    .ai-luxury-landing-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      {% if block.settings.mobile_layout == 'text_first' %}
        order: 2;
      {% else %}
        order: 1;
      {% endif %}
      padding: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_padding }}px;
    }

    .ai-luxury-landing-text-block-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      writing-mode: horizontal-tb;
      text-orientation: mixed;
      font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_text_size }}px;
      text-align: {{ block.settings.mobile_text_alignment }};
    }

    .ai-luxury-landing-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<luxury-landing-{{ ai_gen_id }}
  class="ai-luxury-landing-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  <div class="ai-luxury-landing-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-luxury-landing-left-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-luxury-landing-text-block-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {{- block.settings.text_content -}}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-luxury-landing-right-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-luxury-landing-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.hero_image %}
          <img
            src="{{ block.settings.hero_image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
            alt="{{ block.settings.hero_image.alt | escape }}"
            loading="lazy"
            width="{{ block.settings.hero_image.width }}"
            height="{{ block.settings.hero_image.height }}"
            class="ai-luxury-landing-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          >
        {% else %}
          <div class="ai-luxury-landing-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ 'hero-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
            <div class="ai-luxury-landing-empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              画像を追加してください
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</luxury-landing-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class LuxuryLanding{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
      }
    }

    customElements.define('luxury-landing-{{ ai_gen_id }}', LuxuryLanding{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

